{"id":"n14844-2-8","stage":4,"title":"가라앉히다 · 使镇定","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n14844-2-8-1","ko":"큰일 났네! 지갑을 어디에 두었는지 모르겠어.","zh":"糟了！我不知道钱包放哪儿了。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"큰일","meaning":"大事","explanation":"큰일：大事","readings":[{"term":"큰일","audio":"/audio/dbfb08997ec518d3dc88.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"72174","senseId":"2","lemma":"큰일","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"났네!","meaning":"发生","explanation":"나다：发生；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；네：对新发现的情况表示感叹或确认，非敬语句末。","readings":[{"term":"나다","audio":"/audio/1a06e246c5fb49e2814c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62210","senseId":"7","lemma":"나다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"지갑을","meaning":"钱包，钱夹，钱袋","explanation":"지갑：钱包，钱夹，钱袋；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"지갑","audio":"/audio/523a0f1558bc4c4dce2b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"31502","senseId":"1","lemma":"지갑","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"어디에","meaning":"哪里，哪儿","explanation":"어디：哪里，哪儿；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"어디","audio":"/audio/c1ee1b7e560f9f3ac3bf.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60319","senseId":"1","lemma":"어디","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"두었는지","meaning":"搁，放置，摆放","explanation":"두다：搁，放置，摆放；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；는지：引入未确定的信息、间接疑问或选择：“是否、怎么、何时”等。","readings":[{"term":"두다","audio":"/audio/531b2c3977c491e8379e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67470","senseId":"1","lemma":"두다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"모르겠어.","meaning":"不知道，不认识，不懂","explanation":"모르다：不知道，不认识，不懂；겠：表示意愿、推测或礼貌委婉，结合整句判断。；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"모르다","audio":"/audio/20ef19694f337fd42539.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"29712","senseId":"1","lemma":"모르다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"dbfb08997ec518d3","term":"큰일","zh":"大事","audio":"/audio/dbfb08997ec518d3dc88.mp3","entryId":"72174","definition":"无法挽回的大事故或不好的事情。","pronunciation":["크닐"]},{"id":"1a06e246c5fb49e2","term":"나다","zh":"发生","audio":"/audio/1a06e246c5fb49e2814c.mp3","entryId":"62210","definition":"出现某种现象或事件。","pronunciation":["나다"]},{"id":"523a0f1558bc4c4d","term":"지갑","zh":"钱包，钱夹，钱袋","audio":"/audio/523a0f1558bc4c4dce2b.mp3","entryId":"31502","definition":"为便于携带钱、卡、名片等物品，用皮或布料制作的小包。","pronunciation":["지갑"]},{"id":"c1ee1b7e560f9f3a","term":"어디","zh":"哪里，哪儿","audio":"/audio/c1ee1b7e560f9f3ac3bf.mp3","entryId":"60319","definition":"指代不知道的处所。","pronunciation":["어디"]},{"id":"531b2c3977c491e8","term":"두다","zh":"搁，放置，摆放","audio":"/audio/531b2c3977c491e8379e.mp3","entryId":"67470","definition":"放在某处。","pronunciation":["두다"]},{"id":"20ef19694f337fd4","term":"모르다","zh":"不知道，不认识，不懂","audio":"/audio/20ef19694f337fd42539.mp3","entryId":"29712","definition":"不清楚或不了解人或事物、事实等。","pronunciation":["모ː르다"]}],"audio":"/audio/00d05c84de3e4242aa87.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n14844-2-8-2","ko":"흥분을 조금 가라앉히고 천천히 생각을 해 봐.","zh":"先冷静下来，慢慢想想吧。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"흥분을","meaning":"兴奋","explanation":"흥분：兴奋；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"흥분","audio":"/audio/6943e6a2835bf0700b9f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"87056","senseId":"1","lemma":"흥분","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"조금","meaning":"一点点，稍微，略微","explanation":"조금：一点点，稍微，略微","readings":[{"term":"조금","audio":"/audio/b4049b7414b62d9bee5d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61176","senseId":"1","lemma":"조금","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"가라앉히고","meaning":"使镇定，使平静","explanation":"가라앉히다：使镇定，使平静；고：连接并列或先后的动作、状态；也用于 -고 있다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"가라앉히다","audio":"/audio/b6c093e3c9475a3ce91c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"14844","senseId":"2","lemma":"가라앉히다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"천천히","meaning":"慢慢地，缓慢地","explanation":"천천히：慢慢地，缓慢地","readings":[{"term":"천천히","audio":"/audio/71c0b7db98a074453c87.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"26902","senseId":"1","lemma":"천천히","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"생각을","meaning":"想，思考","explanation":"생각：想，思考；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"생각","audio":"/audio/6ac12a8f8e4e4c22657b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58162","senseId":"1","lemma":"생각","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"해","meaning":"做，干","explanation":"하다：做，干；어：连接后续动作或辅助表达；常与前面的词干缩合。","readings":[{"term":"하다","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73277","senseId":"1","lemma":"하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"봐.","meaning":"试着做（-아/어 보다）","explanation":"보다：试着做（-아/어 보다）；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"보다","audio":"/audio/6a45cf834264a5ec3611.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62171","senseId":"1","lemma":"보다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"6943e6a2835bf070","term":"흥분","zh":"兴奋","audio":"/audio/6943e6a2835bf0700b9f.mp3","entryId":"87056","definition":"由于受到某种刺激而导致感情激昂；或指该情绪。","pronunciation":["흥분"]},{"id":"b4049b7414b62d9b","term":"조금","zh":"一点点，稍微，略微","audio":"/audio/b4049b7414b62d9bee5d.mp3","entryId":"61176","definition":"微量或微小的程度。","pronunciation":["조금"]},{"id":"b6c093e3c9475a3c","term":"가라앉히다","zh":"使镇定，使平静","audio":"/audio/b6c093e3c9475a3ce91c.mp3","entryId":"14844","definition":"使强烈的感情或心情变弱或消失。","pronunciation":["가라안치다"]},{"id":"71c0b7db98a07445","term":"천천히","zh":"慢慢地，缓慢地","audio":"/audio/71c0b7db98a074453c87.mp3","entryId":"26902","definition":"动作或态度缓缓地。","pronunciation":["천ː천히"]},{"id":"6ac12a8f8e4e4c22","term":"생각","zh":"想，思考","audio":"/audio/6ac12a8f8e4e4c22657b.mp3","entryId":"58162","definition":"人动脑子后做出判断或认知。","pronunciation":["생각"]},{"id":"505de0a2f6be73fa","term":"하다","zh":"做，干","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3","entryId":"73277","definition":"进行某种行动、动作或活动。","pronunciation":["하다"]},{"id":"6a45cf834264a5ec","term":"보다","zh":"试着做（-아/어 보다）","audio":"/audio/6a45cf834264a5ec3611.mp3","entryId":"62171","definition":"试着做（-아/어 보다）","pronunciation":["보다"]}],"audio":"/audio/c67722f32a278eb4e90d.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":3.129,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=14844","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"2","sourceLevel":"고급","day":148,"sequenceScore":2.9557,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["先冷静下来，慢慢想想吧。","你有什么人生哲学吗？","糟了！我不知道钱包放哪儿了。"],"answer":2},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["先冷静下来，慢慢想想吧。","糟了！我不知道钱包放哪儿了。","你有什么人生哲学吗？"],"answer":0}]}
